# Repository organization plan

Approved September 13, 2026. Branch: `repo-organization`, starting from root
`8edf324` and Client `492df8a3`. This is a layout/build-maintenance change, not
the public-history sanitization or a protocol/runtime redesign.

## Checkpoints

## Boundaries

- Never change installed system paths, services, protocol or media behavior as
  part of a directory move. No deployments or reboots required for this pass.
- Do not delete public Git history, change repository visibility, remove
  upstream attribution or rotate credentials here.
- Keep ignored build/cache state out of product folders and artifacts. Do not
  delete retained dependencies when moving tracked submodules.
- Do not publish or merge the branch until the layout validation is complete.
- Existing macOS Client human audio/input/toolbar/Quit/Wacom and broader
  hardware acceptance gates remain open; see the current handoff.

## Result

All five checkpoints completed September 13. Six branch-qualified packages
were built from clean source `b12dc9d`; all package gates pass, including Mac
signing/notarization/stapling. No deployment or runtime redesign. The branch
remains separate from main for review. See
[validation](../reviews/repository-organization-validation.md) and HANDOFF.
